{"id":"n73711-1-20","stage":2,"title":"작동 · 运转","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73711-1-20-1","ko":"오늘 같이 더운 날에 에어컨을 왜 안 트니?","zh":"今天这么热的天，为什么不开空调啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더운","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날에","meaning":"日子，时光","explanation":"날：日子，时光；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"5","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"에어컨을","meaning":"空调","explanation":"에어컨：空调；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"에어컨","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62514","senseId":"1","lemma":"에어컨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"트니?","meaning":"打开，开","explanation":"틀다：打开，开；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"틀다","audio":"/audio/2d0358325f7b60f9b306.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89816","senseId":"4","lemma":"틀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"日子，时光","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"某种时节或时候。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"4641fbad3b128edd","term":"에어컨","zh":"空调","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3","entryId":"62514","definition":"可以吹出凉快的空气、调节湿度的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"2d0358325f7b60f9","term":"틀다","zh":"打开，开","audio":"/audio/2d0358325f7b60f9b306.mp3","entryId":"89816","definition":"启动机械或装置。","pronunciation":["틀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1944f1318028317b994e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73711-1-20-2","ko":"에어컨이 고장이 나서 작동이 안 돼.","zh":"空调坏了，所以没法使用。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"에어컨이","meaning":"空调","explanation":"에어컨：空调；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"에어컨","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62514","senseId":"1","lemma":"에어컨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고장이","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나서","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작동이","meaning":"运转，启动，发动","explanation":"작동：运转，启动，发动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"작동","audio":"/audio/470ae4e42a163c865fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73711","senseId":"1","lemma":"작동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4641fbad3b128edd","term":"에어컨","zh":"空调","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3","entryId":"62514","definition":"可以吹出凉快的空气、调节湿度的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a1a759c684921a8d","term":"고장","zh":"故障","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3","entryId":"18856","definition":"机器或装置等不能正常运行。","pronunciation":["고ː장"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"470ae4e42a163c86","term":"작동","zh":"运转，启动，发动","audio":"/audio/470ae4e42a163c865fae.mp3","entryId":"73711","definition":"机器等开动工作；或使机器等开动工作。","pronunciation":["작똥"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio